WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.758
Unit six. Sports and Injury Safety!

2
00:00:04.709 --> 00:00:08.332
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.382 --> 00:00:11.221
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.271 --> 00:00:14.969
Today we learn about Sports and Injury Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.957 --> 00:00:19.424
Warm-up. Say it with me. Warm-up!

6
00:00:22.907 --> 00:00:26.223
Stretch. Say it with me. Stretch!

7
00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:33.608
Overuse injury. Say it with me. Overuse injury!

8
00:00:37.057 --> 00:00:40.957
Protective equipment. Say it with me. Protective equipment!

9
00:00:44.457 --> 00:00:47.890
Concussion. Say it with me. Concussion!

10
00:00:51.449 --> 00:00:54.699
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

11
00:00:58.184 --> 00:01:01.484
Hydrate. Say it with me. Hydrate!

12
00:01:04.949 --> 00:01:08.249
Coach. Say it with me. Coach!

13
00:01:11.766 --> 00:01:22.157
A good warm-up and stretch before sports helps prevent an overuse injury. Wearing protective equipment reduces the risk of a serious concussion. My coach reminds me to rest and hydrate during practice.

14
00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:24.837
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:31.661
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.711 --> 00:01:33.144
Overuse injury!

17
00:01:34.157 --> 00:01:39.151
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.201 --> 00:01:40.351
Hydrate!

19
00:01:41.093 --> 00:01:50.698
Did you know? Warm-up programmes of about 10–20 minutes, like FIFA's '11+', have been shown to cut injuries in young football players by around a third or more.

20
00:01:50.748 --> 00:01:52.905
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:54.351 --> 00:02:02.493
Think and answer. What safety steps do you take before playing sports?

22
00:02:02.543 --> 00:02:03.693
Great answer!

23
00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:09.488
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:09.538 --> 00:02:12.196
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

